    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// A signature names what a bundle of declarations must provide; a module" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// provides it; a `template module` is a functor from modules to a module." },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// The one thing this adds over an ordinary typed parameter is that the facts" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// travel *together*: a key, its collection, and how the two spell a degree" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// are useless apart, and passing them one at a time is how they drift" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// (docs/language/04-templates-and-modules.md §4)." },
